        "comments": "The assembly daAjuRept1.hap1.2 is based on 79x PacBio data and Arima2 Hi-C data generated by the Darwin Tree of Life Project\n(https://www.darwintreeoflife.org/). The assembly process included the following sequence of steps: initial PacBio assembly generation with Hifiasm in Hi-C integrated assembly mode, and Hi-C based scaffolding with YaHS. The mitochondrial and chloroplast genomes were assembled using MitoHiFi and OATK. Finally, each haplotype assembly was analysed and manually improved using TreeVal. Chromosome-scale scaffolds confirmed by the Hi-C data have been named in order of size. Haplotipic inversions observed at: Chromosome 1 from 39.40 to 41.29 Kbp, Chromosome 6 from 20.70 to 24.85 Kbp, 40.9 to 42.7 Kbp, Chromosome 7 from 34.87 to 38.08 Kbp, Chromosome 8 from 39.40 to 41.29 Kbp, 31.5 to 34.6 Kbp and Chromosome 11 from 26.31 to 30.29 Kbp, 30.29 to 32.5 Kbp and 34.9 to 44.1Kbp.",
